From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bonsai-27b-fusion <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ggml): port TurboQuant turbo3/turbo4 KV + WHT kernels

Ports the turboquant KV-cache fusion onto the PrismML prism base:
- new: ggml-turbo-quant.c, ggml-cuda/turbo-quant.cuh, turbo-wht.cu/.cuh,
  8 fattn-vec turbo template instances (incl. symmetric turbo3-turbo3 /
  turbo4-turbo4 combos)
- ggml.h: GGML_TYPE_TURBO3_0 / _TURBO4_0 enums + GGML_OP_TURBO_WHT
- ggml-common.h: block_turbo3_0 / block_turbo4_0 layouts
- ggml.c: type traits, op names, GGML_OP_COUNT=102, ggml_turbo_wht()
- ggml-quants.h: turbo3/turbo4 quantize/dequantize API
- ggml-cuda: dequantize.cuh, fattn-common.cuh, fattn-vec.cuh, convert.cu,
  set-rows.cu, ggml-cuda.cu dispatch, CMake source lists
- fix: fork's CMakeLists globbed template-instances/mmf*.cu in both
  ggml-cuda and ggml-hip WITHOUT list(APPEND ...), so every mmf instance
  never linked (undefined mul_mat_f_cuda<...> at link time)

Verified on RX 6900 XT (gfx1030) with Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-PQ2_0.gguf:
prefill 108.3 t/s, generation 44.0 t/s, output correct.
